; village_house.room - Ivo's house (design 04 section 3.1), where a new game starts (x 320, floor row 9).
; One flat floor; the furniture is props (systems/props, Interiors). No gate or puzzle.
; The opening (STORY-03, systems/story): the daughter's poses are a FactStaging under Props; three talks
; (legend t, each centred on her; STORY-14): the bed (col 2, Up, on her in bed at x 58: the errand, "...", her eyes
; at 0.6; it stops 30 px short of the door at col 4), by the door (col 3, auto, 81 px wide, 23 px short of the door:
; the hummed return) and at the guitar (col 9, auto: the played return). The song is no Talkable since STORY-16: the
; HomeReturn cutscene trigger starts it as Ivo comes home with the bread. Beats and triggers are in the contents scene.

; Indoors: wood planks, so no earth turf lip shows; no interior grows grass (systems/grass).

